Output "docs/img/.overview.gif"

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 820
Set Padding 10
Set Theme "Blazer"
Set TypingSpeed 0ms

Hide
Type "./target/release/hydroscope --scenario showcase --slowdown 60"
Enter
Sleep 6500ms
Show
Screenshot "docs/img/overview.png"
Sleep 200ms
Type "q"
Sleep 200ms
